  abilityId: 2850148
  abilityName: Hymn of the Hallowed
  abilityDesc: 30 combo masssive Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), boosts own max HP for all allies, fully restores HP for 3 turns, activates
    Light barrier, high probability of resistance against 1 KO attack & high probability
    of raising allies from KO
